// cpc-a5-png-test — Phase A5-3 MANUAL test (not in all-test-builds).
//
// Tiny CPC464 game in FULL-COLOR mode with one PNG-based BTile.
// Purpose: verify that datagen.pl invokes tools/cpc_asset_convert.pl
// and produces build/generated/cpc/btile.c + .h from the PNG.
//
// The 'cpc-' prefix keeps this OUT of the ZX test subset, and the
// MANUAL_TEST_GAMES exclusion in the top Makefile keeps it out of the
// CPC subset too — so `make all-test-builds[-zx|-cpc]` never touch it
// (A5 phase-exit: "No CPC binary built end-to-end yet"). Exercise by
// hand: make config + data-cpc464 target_game=games/cpc-a5-png-test.
//
// DEVIATION from A5-3 spec (cpc6128 vs cpc464): cpc6128 does not exist
// yet (Phase T3). Using cpc464 (cpc-flat, the only CPC toolchain at A5).
// See A5-3 task note.
//
// CPC_PALETTE: mode-1 default firmware colours (white/black/green/red)
// matching what the ZX PNGTest btile.png was drawn against.
BEGIN_GAME_CONFIG
	NAME		A5CpcPngTest
	PLATFORM	cpc464
	GFX_BACKEND	cpctel
	COLOR		MODE=FULL
	DEFAULT_BG_ATTR	INK_WHITE | PAPER_BLACK
	CPC_PALETTE	13,0,9,3
END_GAME_CONFIG
